{"articleNo":"146723","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=146723&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"경북여행리포터 및 慶游記 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.02.28","hit":"2325","attachments":[{"name":"경북여행리포터.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=146723&attachNo=74109"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">경상북도관광공사에서는 경북나드리 홈페이지와 SNS 등에서 경상북도의 관광자원을 홍보하는 「경북여행리포터」와 「游(경상북도여행기자단)」를 모집하고 있음을 알려드리오니, 많은 참여 바랍니다.</span><br></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 모집개요</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가) 모집기간 : 2016. 2. 19(금). ~ 3. 7(월).&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나) 모집대상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 103.26pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 17.35pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.