"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">경상북도 여행에 관심이 많고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">중국어 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">SNS </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">운영자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">대만</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">홍콩 출신 우대</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다</span>) 활동내용 : 매월 경상북도를 여행하고, 여행기(글, 사진 등) 작성</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 외국인기자의 경우, 모국어(英,中,日)로 여행기 작성</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라) 활동혜택 : 활동비 지급(월 15만원이내), 취재여행(분기당 1회) 참가, 우수 기자 시상 등</span><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 지원방법 : 온라인 지원서